---LINES
var     = ipvx  -       -       -       -         "3.141593"
alt1    = ipax  -       -       -       -         "YES"
a2      = iax   -       -       -       -         "[x]"
mse     = ipmx  -       -       -       -         " Quit "
VAR     = gv - - - - " VAR "
ALT     = ga - - - - " ALT "
MSE     = gm - - - - " MSE "

common  = g  - - - - " common: "
page_n  = g  - - - - " page navigation: "
specia  = g  - - - - " special: "

---SCREEN                                                          
=LINLIB generic keyboard command/actions
                                                                              
+.common...............              .MSE.   .mse..... -select menu item:     
+   .:HE... get help                                        .:NL... or .:SP...
+   .:RE... refresh page                                                      
+   .:EX... exit/close page          .ALT.   .a2       -alter or toggle:      
+   .:CA... cancel                                       forward:      .:SP...
+   .:TA... next line                                    backward:     .:DE...
+                                                                             
+.page_n...............              .VAR.   .var..... -switch to edit:       
+   .:KH... jump to 1st line                             keep content: .:SP...
+   .:KE... jump to last line                            clear field:  .:DE...
+   .:PD... next page/part                                                        
+   .:PU... prev page/part      ."in edit mode"................. ."with prefix".  
+                               .:DE... erase left from cursor               
+.specia...............         .:KD... erase below cursor       .:PR .:DE...	   
+   .:NL... next line,                         erase up to end   .:PR .:SP...    
+           commit,complete     .:KH... jump to 1st symbol       .:PR .:AL...    
+   .:PR... option prefix       .:KE... jump to end of text      .:PR .:AR...    
+                               .:KI... toggle Ins/Ovr mode      .:PR .:PR...    
+                               
=LINLIB (c) 1986-1990,2020 vsv&team
---END                          
+."common"..........            .MSE.   .mse..... -------select menu item:
+."page navigation".            .VAR.   .var..... --------switch to edit: 
+."special".........                erase below cursor:  .:KD...  .:PR .:DE...

.common...............        
   .:HE... get help           
   .:RE... refresh page        
   .:EX... exit/close page       
   .:CA... cancel                 
   .:TA... next line            
                                 
.page_n...............           
   .:KH... jump to 1st line        
   .:KE... jump to last line       
   .:PD... next page/part          
   .:PU... prev page/part         
                                  
.specia...............             
   .:NL... next line,            
           commit,complete          
   .:PR... option prefix
   
   
